    {'para': '**269. Stems ⟨śvan⟩, ⟨yuvan⟩.** The stems ⟨śvan⟩ m., ‘dog’, and ⟨yuvan⟩ m., n., ‘young’, have as weakest stems ⟨śun⟩ and ⟨yūn⟩; in the strong and middle cases they follow ⟨rājan⟩; voc. ⟨śvan⟩, ⟨yuvan⟩. Fem. ⟨śunī⟩ and ⟨yuvati⟩.'},
